From: Samuel Rounce <me@samuelrounce.co.uk>
Subject: [PATCH] d3dx: carry CUR/ICO loading workaround for LMU
Source-commit: 1e2c9c29611850c1887430ad7b65a1a3287dc7fc
Source: https://github.com/JacKeTUs/wine/commit/1e2c9c29611850c1887430ad7b65a1a3287dc7fc

Forward-ported to GE11-6 and GE11-7 by the LMU integration project.
